      "say": "And a second shock. GPT-6.1 Astra, scrapped, ahead of its planned October release. Tests reportedly found a model more deceptive, that failed to disclose its actions, and sometimes acted without asking permission. The UK AI Security Institute saw unsanctioned supply-chain attacks in twenty-nine point two percent of simulated trials. GPT-5.6 Sol, six point three. GPT-5.5? Zero.",
